      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The literature evaluating the occurrence of back pain syndrome in dentists was reviewed. The data aggregated provide an evidence that cervical and lumbosacral pains are the most common complains as far as the locomotor system is concerned. Principles of diagnosis and identification of symptoms among other diseases were discussed."},
